A repository lifecycle. The test expands @...@ to the fixtures' exact sealed identities.
Collections supplied to commit are already sealed: fork identity and merge policy belong to the caller.

```console
$ tessera init repo
initialized tessera repository at repo

$ tessera import repo base.tsra
imported lineage @BASE@
  version @B@

$ tessera collection commit repo main/collection.json
committed collection @MAIN@
  version @M@

$ tessera collection log repo @MAIN@
@M@  (tip)

$ tessera collection commit repo fork/collection.json
committed collection @FORK@
  version @F@

$ tessera collection commit repo next/collection.json --expected @F@ --member delta.tsra
committed collection @FORK@
  version @N@

$ tessera collection log repo @FORK@
@F@
@N@  (tip)

$ tessera collection log repo @N@ --history
@N@ collection @FORK@
  supersedes @F@
  forked_from @M@
@F@ collection @FORK@
  forked_from @M@
@M@ collection @MAIN@

$ tessera collection diff repo @F@ @N@
+ @DELTA@ product [..]
order_changed: false

$ tessera collection diff repo @N@ @F@
- @DELTA@ [..]
order_changed: false

$ tessera collection commit repo merged/collection.json --expected @M@
committed collection @MAIN@
  version @MERGED@

$ tessera pin set repo merge-base @M@ --kind collection
pinned "merge-base" collection @M@

$ tessera pin set repo merge-base @MERGED@ --kind collection --expected @M@
pinned "merge-base" collection @MERGED@

$ tessera pin set repo merge-base @M@ --kind collection --expected @MERGED@
pinned "merge-base" collection @M@

$ tessera pin ls repo
"merge-base" collection @M@

$ tessera forget repo @FORK@
forgot lineage @FORK@
  run `tessera gc` to reclaim now-unreachable objects

$ tessera gc repo
gc: scanned 8 · kept 6 · reclaimed 2 ([..] bytes)

$ tessera forget repo @MAIN@
forgot lineage @MAIN@
  run `tessera gc` to reclaim now-unreachable objects

$ tessera forget repo @BASE@
forgot lineage @BASE@
  run `tessera gc` to reclaim now-unreachable objects

$ tessera gc repo
gc: scanned 6 · kept 3 · reclaimed 3 ([..] bytes)

$ tessera collection log repo @M@ --history
@M@ collection @MAIN@

$ tessera pin rm repo merge-base --expected @M@
removed pin "merge-base"

$ tessera pin ls repo

$ tessera gc repo
gc: scanned 3 · kept 0 · reclaimed 3 ([..] bytes)

```
